IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LON0018.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    05 LTV-PCT            PIC 9(3).
01 WS-RESULTS.
    *> MORTGAGE INSURANCE REQUIRED
    05 MI-REQUIRED        PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 RATE-LOAD          PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM CHECK-LTV
    DISPLAY "MI-REQUIRED=" MI-REQUIRED
    DISPLAY "RATE-LOAD=" RATE-LOAD
    STOP RUN.
CHECK-LTV.
    *> MORTGAGE INSURANCE REQUIREMENT
    IF LTV-PCT > 90
        MOVE 'Y' TO MI-REQUIRED
        MOVE 0.0025 TO RATE-LOAD
    ELSE
        MOVE 'N' TO MI-REQUIRED
    END-IF.
